e="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit37/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11407/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11407" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11407"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasg71rc4/"></a>Основные параметры&#160;<br>внебюджетного Пенсионного фонда при Министерстве финансов Республики Узбекистан на 2019 год</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11408/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11408" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11408"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbz75x4/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdAll" style="width: 78%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11409/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11409" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11409"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaseacn23/"></a><strong>Показатели</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11410/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11410" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11410"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas4ipaf9/"></a><strong>млрд. сум</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 6%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11411/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11411" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anc