-anchor="bssPhr11484"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaslm7v3v/"></a>Развитие материально-технической базы органов по труду, внедрение современных компьютерных технологий</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11485/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11485" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11485"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasapvps9/"></a>82,2</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11486/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11486" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11486"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasornp6k/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11487/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11487" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11487"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas4c8mlg/"></a>Содержание Бюро обеспечения временной разовой работой</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11488/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11488" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11488"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasoaxmxm/"></a>10,7</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11489/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11489" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11489"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaslex2s4/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11490/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11490" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11490"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaswfexf4/"></a>Отчисление в Фонд стимулирования труда работников и укрепления материально-технической базы органов по труду</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11491/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11491" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11491"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaseko3h2/"></a>9,2</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11492/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11492" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11492"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfashw5ggx/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11493/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11493" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11493"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaskpn0ol/"></a>Выделение микрокредитов на реализацию малых и мини-проектов, предусматривающих создание новых рабочих мест в районах и городах республики с напряженной ситуацией на рынке труда</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11494/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11494" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11494"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas7v7wgz/"></a>195,0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11495/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11495" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11495"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasqgzzgc/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11496/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11496" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11496"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas5w6w4d/"></a>Разработка, внедрение и поддержка информационной системы &#171;Единая национальная система труда&#187;, других информационных систем и инфраструктуры ИКТ органов по труду</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11497/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11497" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11497"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasmmv440/"></a>4,7</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11498/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11498" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11498"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasih6cni/"></a>9.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11499/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11499" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11499"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasakb0of/"></a>Финансирование научных разработок, исследований и социологических обследований, а также проведение научно-практических семинаров, конференций и участие в командировках в области труда, занятости и охраны труда</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11500/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11500" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11500"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas5xyggg/"></a>1,9</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11501/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11501" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11501"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasq3u25o/"></a>10.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11502/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11502" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11502"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas7sbm6x/"></a>Финансирование республиканских курсов повышения квалификации работников органов по труду</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11503/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11503" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11503"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaspxd55r/"></a>1,3</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11504/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11504" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11504"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasfh2qwa/"></a>11.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11505/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11505" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11505"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas5ot23a/"></a>Прочие расходы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11506/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11506" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11506"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas0mgw2g/"></a>18,4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11507/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11507" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11507"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaskcy33m/"></a><strong>IV.</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11508/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11508" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11508"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdnu49c/"></a><strong>Остаток средств на конец года</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11509/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11509" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11509"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas9lo62d/"></a><strong>14,6</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11510/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11510" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11510"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfastrh1c4/"></a>Примечание: Министерство занятости и трудовых отношений Республики Узбекистан вправе вносить изменения в параметры прогноза.</p><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11511/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11511" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11511"></a><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit6/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasctnkzy/"></a>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 6<br>к постановлению Президента Республики<br>Узбекистан от 26 декабря 2018 года № ПП-4086</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="1"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit39/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11512/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11512" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11512"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdaipg7/"></a>Основные параметры&#160;<br>Фонда содействия приватизированным предприятиям при Государственном комитете Республики Узбекистан по содействию приватизированным предприятиям и развитию конкуренции на 2019 год</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11513/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11513" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11513"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasow40xy/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11514/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11514" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11514"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfast4l5b0/"></a><strong>Показатели</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11515/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11515" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11515"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasc3trho/"></a><strong>млрд. сум</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11516/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11516" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11516"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbhqv2f/"></a><strong>I.</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11517/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11517" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11517"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasnaxq59/"></a><strong>Остаток средств на начало года</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11518/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11518" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11518"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdpg7eo/"></a><strong>53,0</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11519/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11519" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11519"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasp3d6mh/"></a><strong>II.</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11520/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11520" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11520"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas8p8l3v/"></a><strong>ВСЕГО ДОХОДОВ</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11521/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11521" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11521"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaslqfrm2/"></a><strong>150,0</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11522/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11522" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11522"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasym3fir/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11523/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11523" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11523"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasoozm3v/"></a>Реализация предприятий, акций в уставных фондах хозяйственных обществ, земельных участков и другого имущества, являющегося государственной собственностью</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11524/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11524" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11524"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas6ghcve/"></a>85,0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11525/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11525" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11525"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbkfzg8/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11526/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11526" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11526"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasyhm51a/"></a>Доходы от аренды государственного имущества</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11527/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11527" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11527"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfashzrea3/"></a>28,0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11528/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11528" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11528"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasog08b1/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRi