ижной продукцией</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 10%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11724/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11724" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11724"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdek9g0/"></a>500 000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11725/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11725" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11725"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasd2na6v/"></a>250 000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 8%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11726/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11726" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11726"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasvdl3kd/"></a>200 000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 13%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11727/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11727" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11727"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasmeqa4g/"></a>50 000</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 3%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr11728/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="11728" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr11728"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasi87tvs/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 48%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssP