20/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13020" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13020"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas782t0c/"></a>Ставка единого земельного налога, взимаемого за орошаемые и неорошаемые сельскохозяйственные угодья, определяется исходя из базовой ставки единого земельного налога на орошаемые и неорошаемые сельскохозяйственные угодья и поправочного коэффициента, учитывающего качественную характеристику земельного участка (балл бонитета).</p><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13021/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13021" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13021"></a><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas7t5v49/"></a>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 21<br>к постановлению Президента Республики<br>Узбекистан от 26 декабря 2018 года № ПП-4086</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="1"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit54/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13022/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13022" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13022"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas52as1r/"></a>Предельные&#160;ставки местных сборов</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width: 49%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13023/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13023" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13023"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasqt84gi/"></a><strong>Виды налогов и сборов</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="4" style="width: 50%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13024/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13024" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13024"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaslgag80/"></a><strong>Предельные ставки (в сумах) в месяц</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 49%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13025/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13025" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13025"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgr9igh/"></a>Сбор за право розничной торговли отдельными видами товаров:</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13026/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13026" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13026"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasd6q1zd/"></a>г. Ташкент</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13027/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13027" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13027"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasslbmzb/"></a>г. Нукус, города &#8212; областные центры</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 8%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13028/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13028" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13028"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas51xsnm/"></a>прочие города</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13029/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13029" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13029"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaso7ardq/"></a>прочие населенные пункты</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 49%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13030/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13030" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13030"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasegbmye/"></a>алкогольной продукцией, включая реализацию алкогольной продукции предприятиями общественного питания</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13031/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13031" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13031"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas8ns1e7/"></a>1 216 400</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13032/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13032" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13032"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasv85zcy/"></a>1 013 700</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 8%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13033/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13033" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13033"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbegemh/"></a>810 900</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13034/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13034" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13034"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasq9cmrn/"></a>608 200</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13035/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13035" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13035"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasi7race/"></a>Примечания:</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13036/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13036" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13036"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasr93sdl/"></a>Сбор за право розничной торговли алкогольной продукцией, включая реализацию алкогольной продукции предприятиями общественного питания, поступает на единый счет с дальнейшим распределением средств между бюджетом и Агентством государственных услуг при Министерстве юстиции Республики Узбекистан.</p><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13037/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13037" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13037"></a><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaschu9dw/"></a>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 23<br>к постановлению Президента Республики<br>Узбекистан от 26 декабря 2018 года № ПП-4086</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="1"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit55/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13038/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13038" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13038"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasyhnthw/"></a>Минимальные размеры&#160;<br>налоговой задолженности для обращения взыскания на имущество налогоплательщиков</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width: 70%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13039/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13039" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13039"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasqd8wvz/"></a><strong>Налогоплательщики</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 29%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13040/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13040" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13040"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasxdbm3i/"></a><strong>Минимальный размер (в сумах)</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 70%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13041/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13041" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13041"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas7hf0sg/"></a>Юридические лица и их обособленные подразделения, на которых в соответствии с Налоговым кодексом Республики Узбекистан возложено обязательство по уплате налогов и других обязательных платежей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 29%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13042/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13042" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13042"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasmiwk4a/"></a>4 054 600</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 70%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13043/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13043" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13043"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas1bo3qy/"></a>Физические лица</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 29%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13044/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13044" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13044"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgwgt1v/"></a>1 013 700</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13045/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13045" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13045"></a><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasavakl5/"></a>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 24<br>к постановлению Президента Республики<br>Узбекистан от 26 декабря 2018 года № ПП-4086</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="1"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit56/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13046/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13046" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13046"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasg8sct5/"></a>Минимальные ставки&#160;<br>арендной платы, установленные для физических лиц, сдающих имущество в аренду</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 4%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13047/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13047" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13047"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasp93wq6/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 31%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13048/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13048" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13048"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfase9agou/"></a><strong>Вид имущества, передаваемого в аренду</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 21%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13049/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13049" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13049"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasmt4c8s/"></a><strong>Показатель, характеризующий размер установленной ставки</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 42%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13050/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13050" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13050"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasnzlek2/"></a><strong>Минимальные размеры ставок арендной платы в месяц, сум.</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 11%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13051/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13051" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13051"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfassmvpsp/"></a><strong>г. Ташкент</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13052/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13052" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13052"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasfguzc2/"></a><strong>г. Нукус, города &#8212; областные центры</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 13%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13053/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13053" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13053"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas30lmi1/"></a><strong>другие населенные пункты</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13054/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13054" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13054"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas1n4sb6/"></a><strong>1.</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 95%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13055/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13055" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13055"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasztqaog/"></a><strong>Помещения:</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13056/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13056" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13056"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas6tvg3n/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13057/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13057" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13057"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaskp90qh/"></a>жилое помещение</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 21%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13058/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13058" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13058"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasyx1gaw/"></a>за 1 кв. метр общей площади</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 11%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13059/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13059" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13059"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaskwgneo/"></a>10 000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13060/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13060" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13060"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfascip06f/"></a>6 500</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 13%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13061/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13061" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13061"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas35fexr/"></a>3 000</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13062/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13062" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13062"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasc7gzut/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13063/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13063" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13063"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaslw5fwu/"></a>нежилое помещение</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 11%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13064/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13064" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13064"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfashqqutx/"></a>20 000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13065/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13065" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13065"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasirukf3/"></a>13 000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 13%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13066/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13066" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13066"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasaxhpzd/"></a>6 000</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13067/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13067" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13067"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasng26gf/"></a><strong>2.</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 95%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13068/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13068" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13068"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasd6inys/"></a><strong>Автомобильный транспорт:</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13069/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13069" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13069"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas6mr6k1/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13070/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13070" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13070"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas3oavxd/"></a>легковой автомобиль (автотранспортное средство, предназначенное для перевозки пассажиров, багажа и имеющее не более 8 мест для посадки, не считая места водителя)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 21%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13071/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13071" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13071"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgzgd95/"></a>за 1 автотранспортное средство</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 42%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13072/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13072" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13072"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasrq78ik/"></a>480 000</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13073/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13073" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13073"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdp2ldq/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13074/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13074" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13074"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbhdzxz/"></a>микроавтобусы, автобусы и грузовые автомобили</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 42%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13075/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13075" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13075"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas4bv6o4/"></a>940 000</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13076/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13076" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13076"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasyrub0t/"></a>Примечание: Данные ставки применяются в целях налогообложения доходов физических лиц от сдачи имущества в аренду.</p><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13077/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13077" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13077"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfascu3wgf/"></a>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 26<br>к постановлению Президента Республики<br>Узбекистан от 26 декабря 2018 года № ПП-4086</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="1"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit57/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13078/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13078" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13078"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfascfsgbh/"></a>ПЕРЕЧЕНЬ&#160;<br>налогов и неналоговых платежей, поступления по которым зачисляются в полном объеме в бюджеты районов и городов</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13079/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13079" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13079"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas66lp8g/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 94%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13080/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13080" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13080"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasp2356p/"></a><strong>Виды налогов и сборов</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13081/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13081" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13081"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasg89kz5/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 94%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13082/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13082" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13082"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas1wgg0v/"></a>Налог за пользование недрами по отдельным нерудным строительным материалам (кроме цементного сырья и известняка)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13083/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13083" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13083"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasvygx4e/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 94%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13084/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13084" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13084"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfascwkkui/"></a>Поступления от штрафов:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13085/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13085" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13085"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas54yogp/"></a>за налоговые правонарушения, предусмотренные статьями 113, 114, 119 и 121 Налогового кодекса Республики Узбекистан;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13086/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13086" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13086"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaswi19iw/"></a>за административные правонарушения, предусмотренные статьями 493, 50, 511, 64 *, 99, 109, 110, 161, 164, 165, 1651, 176, 178, 1861 Кодекса Республики Узбекистан об административной ответственности</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13087/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13087" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13087"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasqtxrai/"></a>* Только в г. Ташкенте.</p><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13088/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13088" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13088"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas2pnsze/"></a>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 27<br>к постановлению Президента Республики<br>Узбекистан от 26 декабря 2018 года № ПП-4086</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="1"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/18678/tit58/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13089/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13089" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13089"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasn75udo/"></a>Перечень&#160;<br>бюджетных организаций, финансирование которых передается из республиканского бюджета Республики Узбекистан в бюджет Республики Каракалпакстан, местные бюджеты областей и г. Ташкента</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13090/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13090" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13090"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfascw1g1u/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdAll" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13091/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13091" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13091"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgrygrl/"></a><strong>Наименование бюджетных учреждений</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13092/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13092" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13092"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasu5vv6c/"></a><strong>I</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13093/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13093" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13093"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdm9v51/"></a><strong>в республиканский бюджет Республики Каракалпакстан, областные бюджеты областей и г. Ташкента </strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13094/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13094" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13094"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasklpvgr/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13095/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13095" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13095"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasqpsx4d/"></a>Министерство финансов Республики Каракалпакстан, главные финансовые управления хокимиятов областей и г. Ташкента</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13096/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13096" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13096"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbg08h8/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13097/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13097" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13097"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas1dq9fc/"></a>Территориальные управления государственного финансового контроля Министерства финансов Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13098/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13098" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13098"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasscgwte/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13099/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13099" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13099"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasif79qz/"></a>Управления Казначейства по Республике Каракалпакстан, областям и г. Ташкенту, отделения Казначейства по районам (городам)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13100/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13100" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13100"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasmdvg2n/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13101/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13101" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13101"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfashwtgd3/"></a>Управления внебюджетного Пенсионного фонда при Министерстве финансов Республики Узбекистан в Республике Каракалпакстан, областях и г. Ташкенте</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13102/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13102" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13102"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaste4rkp/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13103/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13103" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13103"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfashacbl6/"></a>Комитет по содействию приватизированным предприятиям и развитию конкуренции Республики Каракалпакстан, территориальные управления по содействию приватизированным предприятиям и развитию конкуренции областей и города Ташкента</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13104/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13104" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13104"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasa6xqgf/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13105/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13105" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13105"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasc41n9l/"></a>Территориальные управления по контролю и координации деятельности рынка ценных бумаг</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13106/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13106" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13106"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas2tixub/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13107/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13107" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13107"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas6lgwwb/"></a>Министерство юстиции Республики Каракалпакстан, управления юстиции областей и города Ташкента</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13108/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13108" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13108"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasac68xw/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13109/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13109" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13109"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas391twi/"></a>Территориальные управления профессионального образования Республики Каракалпакстан, областей и города Ташкента</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13110/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13110" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13110"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfascta2v5/"></a>9.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13111/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13111" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13111"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaseryqt0/"></a>Территориальные филиалы Республиканского центра повышения квалификации и специализации средних медицинских и фармацевтических работников</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13112/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13112" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13112"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasnz77fh/"></a>10.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13113/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13113" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13113"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasxpv49z/"></a>Профессиональный учебный центр Министерства здравоохранения Республики Узбекистан в Наманганской области (при санатории Пахталикул)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13114/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13114" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13114"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasu7f37v/"></a>11.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13115/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13115" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13115"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaskkaq47/"></a>Территориальные инспекции по карантину растений</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13116/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13116" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13116"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasz7ys1p/"></a>12.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13117/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13117" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13117"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfase4fk9o/"></a>Главные врачебно-трудовые экспертные комиссии Республики Каракалпакстан, областей и г. Ташкента</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13118/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13118" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13118"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasnw555n/"></a>13.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13119/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13119" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13119"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasnoqpqr/"></a>Информационно-библиотечные центры Республики Каракалпакстан, областей и города Ташкента</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13120/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13120" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13120"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas6zepg7/"></a>14.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13121/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13121" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13121"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaslq548n/"></a>Комитет Республики Каракалпакстан по экологии и охране окружающей среды, управлении по экологии и охране окружающей среды областей и города Ташкента, Комплексный (ландшафтного) заказник &#171;Сайгачий&#187;, Бухарский специализированный питомник &#171;Джейран&#187;, Гиссарский государственный заповедник</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13122/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13122" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13122"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas0zsdat/"></a>15.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13123/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13123" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13123"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas0ni7yn/"></a>Приаральское дельтовое управление Республики Каракалпакстан, Управление берегозащитных дамб и руслорегулирующих сооружений Республики Каракалпакстан, Областные Управления эксплуатации водохранилищ</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13124/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13124" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13124"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdds3hl/"></a>16.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 93.79%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13125/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13125" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13125"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasl9iz18/"></a>Мелиоративная экспедиция при бассейновом управлении ирригационных систем областей при Министерстве водного хозяйства Республики Каракалпакстан</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 6.05%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13126/" data-role="phrase-anchor"