eft; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13385/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13385" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13385"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasikf4ua/"></a>28 435,8</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 77%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13386/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13386" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13386"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasc1psbk/"></a>Сырдарьинская область</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 22%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13387/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13387" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13387"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasqhsge1/"></a>12 053,0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 77%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13388/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13388" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13388"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas62gpwl/"></a>Ташкентская область</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 22%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13389/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13389" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13389"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaslk9dmo/"></a>31 376,4</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 77%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr13390/" data-ro