678/dfasuvp8ed/"></a>0902100001,</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14141/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14141" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14141"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas52wqn1/"></a>0902300001</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14142/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14142" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14142"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasq0qg82/"></a>прочий чай в первичных упаковках нетто-массой не более 3 кг в одноразовой упаковке</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14143/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14143" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14143"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgmky8k/"></a>15</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14144/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14144" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14144"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasm8em1x/"></a>0903000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14145/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14145" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14145"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasb72vyz/"></a>Мате, или парагвайский чай</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/