 bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14157/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14157" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14157"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfassgwh3g/"></a>Гвоздика (целые плоды, цветы и цветоножки)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14158/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14158" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14158"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasc7o8f8/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14159/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14159" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14159"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasqhlytb/"></a>0908</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14160/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14160" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14160"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasvz5h06/"></a>Мускатный орех, мацис и кардамон</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14161/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14161" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14161"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasz5ct0z/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor