text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14508/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14508" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14508"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasw1wcpv/"></a>2401</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14509/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14509" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14509"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfascar5ae/"></a>Табачное сырье; табачные отходы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14510/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14510" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14510"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasek2mh1/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14511/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14511" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14511"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasp2uxs2/"></a>2402</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14512/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14512" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14512"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasfmigfg/"></a>Сигары, сигары с обрезанными концами, сигариллы и сигареты из табака или его заменителей, кроме:</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14513/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14513" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14513"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas8gu0fk/"></a>30, но не менее 3 долл.США/1000 шт</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14514/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14514" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14514"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasmetwxv/"></a>2402209000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14515/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14515" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14515"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas3ebfiq/"></a>Прочие сигареты, содержащие табак</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14516/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14516" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14516"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasa7v4si/"></a>30, но не менее 5 долл.США/1000 шт</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14517/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14517" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14517"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas7no0mo/"></a>2403</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14518/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14518" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14518"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfashqyiyg/"></a>Прочий промышленно изготовленный табак и промышленные заменители табака; табак &#171;гомогенизированный&#187; или &#171;восстановленный&#187;; табачные экстракты и эссенции</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14519/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14519" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14519"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasz0q22w/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14520/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14520" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14520"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas5d6u0c/"></a>250100</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14521/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14521" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14521"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas1qcuim/"></a>Соль (включая соль столовую и денатурированную) и хлорид натрия чистый, растворенные или не растворенные в воде, или содержащие или не содержащие добавки агентов, препятствующих слипанию или обеспечивающих сыпучесть; вода морская</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14522/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14522" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14522"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgnmxll/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14523/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14523" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14523"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasxqe4tc/"></a>2502000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14524/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14524" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14524"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasce6vqh/"></a>Пирит необожженный</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14525/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14525" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14525"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaskwkgi3/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14526/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14526" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14526"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasuthd9r/"></a>250300</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14527/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14527" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14527"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas1ay5ll/"></a>Сера всех видов, кроме серы сублимированной, осажденной и коллоидной</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14528/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14528" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14528"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasrqgtpd/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14529/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14529" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14529"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasg78y90/"></a>2504</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14530/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14530" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14530"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas4179uw/"></a>Графит природный</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14531/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14531" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14531"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasm1g6s4/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14532/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14532" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14532"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas9c7nbk/"></a>2505</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14533/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14533" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14533"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaswc6qgl/"></a>Пески природные всех видов, окрашенные или неокрашенные, кроме металлоносных песков группы 26</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14534/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14534" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14534"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasctvto3/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14535/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14535" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14535"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasnxnzxp/"></a>2506</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14536/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14536" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14536"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasv744fy/"></a>Кварц (кроме песков природных); кварцит, грубо раздробленный или нераздробленный, распиленный или нераспиленный, или разделенный другим способом на блоки или плиты прямоугольной (включая квадратную) формы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14537/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14537" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14537"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasfe7sa9/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14538/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14538" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14538"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasg84ywt/"></a>250700</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14539/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14539" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14539"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfashk8cqq/"></a>Каолин и глины каолиновые прочие, кальцинированные или некальцинированные</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14540/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14540" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14540"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas3g1mgf/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14541/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14541" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14541"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaszc9dll/"></a>2508</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14542/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14542" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14542"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasw0a6dz/"></a>Глины прочие (исключая вспученные глины товарной позиции 6806), андалузит, кианит и силлиманит, кальцинированные или некальцинированные; муллит; земли шамотные или динасовые</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14543/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14543" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14543"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdyd5v6/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14544/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14544" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14544"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasw2f23l/"></a>2509000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14545/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14545" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14545"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasyyptq8/"></a>Мел</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14546/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14546" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14546"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasyhgbhm/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14547/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14547" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14547"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas16rbpa/"></a>2510</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14548/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14548" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14548"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasb8497t/"></a>Фосфаты кальция природные, фосфаты алюминиево-кальциевые природные и мел фосфатный</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14549/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14549" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14549"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaszplb13/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14550/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14550" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14550"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas9lsdtd/"></a>2511</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14551/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14551" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14551"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas91p66v/"></a>Сульфат бария природный (барит); карбонат бария природный (витерит), кальцинированный или некальцинированный, кроме оксида бария товарной позиции 2816</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14552/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14552" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14552"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas7ez6m3/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14553/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14553" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14553"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfastze8td/"></a>2512000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14554/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14554" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14554"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasamovbz/"></a>Земли инфузорные кремнистые (напр. кизельгур, трепел и диатомит) и аналогичные кремнистые земли, кальцинированные или некальцинированные, с удельным весом 1 или менее</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14555/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14555" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14555"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasxtnyan/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14556/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14556" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14556"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaso412eb/"></a>2513</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14557/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14557" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14557"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasxgm5me/"></a>Пемза; наждак; корунд природный, гранат природный и прочие природные абразивные материалы, термически обработанные или необработанные</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14558/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14558" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14558"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas6c8i7s/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14559/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14559" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14559"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasi5zdd0/"></a>2514000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14560/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14560" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14560"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas05emzb/"></a>Сланец, грубо раздробленый или нераздробленный, распиленный или нераспиленный, либо разделенный другим способом на блоки или плиты прямоугольной (включая квадратную) формы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14561/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14561" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14561"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfashsgdul/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14562/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14562" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14562"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasesuclu/"></a>2515</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14563/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14563" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14563"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasp4xnp4/"></a>Мрамор, травертин, или известковый туф, экауссин и другие известняки для памятников или строительства с удельным весом 2,5 или более, и алебастр, грубо раздробленные или нераздробленные, распиленные или нераспиленные, либо разделенные другим способом на блоки или плиты прямоугольной (включая квадратную) формы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14564/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14564" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14564"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfashit5pr/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14565/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14565" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14565"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas2svqy6/"></a>2516</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14566/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14566" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14566"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasqzxgrs/"></a>Гранит, порфир, базальт, песчаник и камень для памятников или строительства прочий, грубо раздробленные или нераздробленные, распиленные или нераспиленные, либо разделенные другим способом на блоки или плиты прямоугольной (включая квадратную) формы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14567/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14567" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14567"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfassgm254/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14568/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14568" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14568"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas5x8g1q/"></a>2517</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14569/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14569" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14569"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas8qf79f/"></a>Галька, гравий, щебень или дробленый камень, обычно используемые в качестве наполнителей бетона, балласта для шоссейных дорог или железнодорожных путей или другого балласта, галька, а также валуны и кремневый гравий, термически обработанные или необработанные; макадам из шлака, дросса или аналогичных промышленных отходов, включающий или не включающий материалы, указанные в первой части товарной позиции; гудронированный макадам; гранулы, крошка и порошок из камня товарной позиции 2515 или 2516, термически обработанные или необработанные</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14570/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14570" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14570"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasihgkc2/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14571/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14571" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14571"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas42ylsg/"></a>2518</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14572/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14572" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14572"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas0ptb04/"></a>Доломит, кальцинированный или некальцинированный, спекшийся или неспекшийся, включая доломит грубо раздробленный или распиленный, либо разделенный другим способом на блоки или плиты прямоугольной (включая квадратную) формы; доломитовая набивочная смесь</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14573/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14573" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14573"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasag0fi3/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14574/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14574" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14574"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas5qzptr/"></a>2519</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14575/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14575" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14575"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgb7qp1/"></a>Карбонат магния природный (магнезит); магнезия плавленая; магнезия обожженная до спекания (агломерированная), содержащая или не содержащая небольшие количества других оксидов, добавляемых перед агломерацией; прочие оксиды магния, с примесями или без примесей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14576/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14576" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14576"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfase0byex/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14577/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14577" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14577"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasczi2zo/"></a>2520</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14578/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14578" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14578"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasay8b00/"></a>Гипс; ангидрит; гипсовые вяжущие (представляющие собой кальцинированный гипс или сульфат кальция), окрашенные или неокрашенные, содержащие или не содержащие небольшие количества ускорителей или замедлителей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14579/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14579" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14579"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasnpqcag/"></a>20</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14580/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14580" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14580"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaswoeibr/"></a>2521000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14581/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14581" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14581"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas3wzbur/"></a>Флюс известняковый; известняк и прочий известняковый камень, используемый для изготовления извести или цемента</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14582/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14582" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14582"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas0c35n1/"></a>20</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14583/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14583" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14583"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas2a5ryg/"></a>2522</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14584/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14584" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14584"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgvqvqx/"></a>Известь негашеная, гашеная и гидравлическая, кроме оксида и гидроксида кальция, указанных в товарной позиции 2825</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14585/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14585" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14585"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas59rdya/"></a>20</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14586/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14586" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14586"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasowr9fb/"></a>2523</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14587/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14587" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14587"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaspn2prg/"></a>Портландцемент, цемент глиноземистый, цемент шлаковый, цемент суперсульфатный и аналогичные гидравлические цементы, неокрашенные или окрашенные, готовые или в форме клинкеров</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14588/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14588" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14588"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasw0r5hw/"></a>20</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14589/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14589" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14589"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasp9h5nq/"></a>2524</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14590/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14590" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14590"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas92v6so/"></a>Асбест</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14591/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14591" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14591"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas70s92t/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14592/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14592" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14592"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgb9gdq/"></a>2525</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14593/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14593" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14593"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas8cfvt3/"></a>Слюда, в том числе расслоенная; слюдяные отходы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14594/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14594" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14594"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasro300o/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14595/" data-role="ph