ss="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14673/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14673" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14673"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasghu8sn/"></a>2702</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14674/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14674" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14674"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas0uptkh/"></a>Лигнит, или бурый уголь, агломерированный или неагломерированный, кроме гагата</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14675/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14675" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14675"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas5ivir4/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14676/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14676" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14676"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasghs6s1/"></a>2703000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14677/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14677" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14677"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfased4fcu/"></a>Торф (включая торфяную крошку), агломерированный или неагломерированный</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14678/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14678" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14678"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasus4q5g/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14679/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14679" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14679"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaslaren9/"></a>270400</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14680/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14680" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14680"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasaisedc/"></a>Кокс и полукокс из каменного угля, лигнита или торфа, агломерированные или неагломерированные; уголь ретортный</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14681/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14681" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14681"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas4ni8ix/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14682/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14682" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14682"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasq040yq/"></a>2705000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14683/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14683" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14683"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas9vs85t/"></a>Газ каменноугольный, водяной, генераторный и аналогичные газы, кроме нефтяных газов и других газообразных углеводородов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14684/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14684" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14684"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasen7dlo/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14685/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14685" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14685"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasmn38bu/"></a>2706000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14686/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14686" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14686"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas9gtp0e/"></a>Смолы каменноугольные, буроугольные, торфяные и проч. минеральн. смолы, обезвоженные или необезвоженные, частично ректифицированные или неректифицированные, включая &#171;восстановленные&#187; смолы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14687/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14687" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14687"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasxbfvfb/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14688/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14688" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14688"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasya8571/"></a>2707</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14689/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14689" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14689"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas721mbz/"></a>Масла и другие продукты высокотемпературной перегонки каменноугольной смолы; аналогичные продукты, в которых масса ароматических составных частей превышает массу неароматических</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14690/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14690" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14690"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasiblxc1/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14691/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14691" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14691"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasr3nyvo/"></a>2708</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14692/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14692" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14692"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfast27080/"></a>Пек и кокс пековый, полученные из каменноугольной смолы или прочих минеральных смол</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14693/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14693" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14693"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaseaikuo/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14694/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14694" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14694"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfastktd42/"></a>270900</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14695/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14695" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14695"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasfyd4qt/"></a>Нефть сырая и нефтепродукты сырые, полученные из битуминозных пород</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14696/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14696" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14696"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdqq6np/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14697/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14697" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14697"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaslvcvkw/"></a>2710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14698/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14698" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14698"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasuvbcp1/"></a>Нефть и нефтепродукты, полученные из битуминозных пород, кроме сырых; продукты, в другом месте не поименованные или не включенные, содержащие 70 мас.% или более нефти или нефтепродуктов, полученных из битуминозных пород, причем эти нефтепродукты являются основными составляющими продуктов; отработанные нефтепродукты:</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14699/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14699" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14699"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgggac3/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14700/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14700" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14700"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfast1hyif/"></a>2710 19 820 0</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14701/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14701" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14701"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas2dgdee/"></a>моторные масла, компрессорное смазочное масло, турбинное смазочное масло</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14702/