hor="bssPhr14852"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas7pnsgr/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14853/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14853" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14853"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaswg4teu/"></a>2840</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14854/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14854" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14854"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas75fm7a/"></a>Бораты; пероксобораты (пербораты)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14855/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14855" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14855"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas1mme8y/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14856/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14856" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14856"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdlglqa/"></a>2841</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14857/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14857" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14857"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasphfgr2/"></a>Соли оксометаллических или пероксометаллических кислот</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14858/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14858" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14858"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasmyesqe/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14859/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14859" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14859"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas4982kv/"></a>2842</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14860/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14860" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14860"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasrw1dgp/"></a>Соли неорганических кислот или пероксокислот (включая алюмосиликаты определенного или неопределенного химического состава), кроме азидов, прочие</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14861/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14861" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14861"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbnxvbi/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14862/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14862" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14862"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas8fnhhk/"></a>2843</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14863/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14863" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14863"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasep92kr/"></a>Металлы драгоценные в коллоидном состоянии; соединения неорганические или органи&#65533;еские драгоценных металлов, определенного или неопределенного химического состава; амальгамы драгоценных металлов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14864/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14864" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14864"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbtg4cg/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14865/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14865" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14865"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasu0ou9c/"></a>2844</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14866/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14866" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14866"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas5evcci/"></a>Элементы химические радиоактивные и изотопы радиоактивные (включая делящиеся или воспроизводящиеся химические элементы и изотопы) и их соединения; смеси и остатки, содержащие эти продукты</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14867/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14867" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14867"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbiz4gi/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14868/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14868" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14868"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasl8mp6d/"></a>2845</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14869/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14869" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14869"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasi1somi/"></a>Изотопы, кроме изотопов товарной позиции 2844; соединения неорганические или органические этих изотопов, определенного или неопределенного химического состава</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14870/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14870" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14870"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasv3iyck/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14871/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14871" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14871"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasohqt3r/"></a>2846</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14872/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14872" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14872"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbkhwgp/"></a>Соединения, неорганические или органические, редкоземельных металлов, иттрия или скандия или смесей этих металлов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14873/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14873" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14873"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasybqngs/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14874/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14874" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14874"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfashabot4/"></a>2847000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14875/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14875" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14875"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaswt44y5/"></a>Пероксид водорода, отвержденный или не отвержденный мочевиной</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14876/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14876" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14876"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas81oqzk/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14877/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14877" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14877"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasteqy47/"></a>2849</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14878/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14878" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14878"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdo09xp/"></a>Карбиды, определенного или неопределенного химического состава</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14879/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14879" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14879"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasz9p9ci/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14880/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14880" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14880"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas0bp6m6/"></a>285000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14881/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14881" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14881"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfassuy1y1/"></a>Гидриды, нитриды, азиды, силициды и бориды, определенного или неопределенного химического состава, кроме соединений, являющихся карбидами товарной позиции 2849</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14882/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14882" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14882"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasme5x0c/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14883/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14883" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14883"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasf9cesg/"></a>2852</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14884/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14884" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14884"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasoodnm8/"></a>Соединения ртути, неорганические или органические, определенного или неопределенного химического состава, кроме амальгам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14885/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14885" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14885"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasmexvmi/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14886/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14886" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14886"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas9kbgzx/"></a>2853</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14887/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14887" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14887"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas2q1mr4/"></a>Фосфиды, определенного или неопределенного химического состава, за исключением феррофосфора; соединения неорганические прочие (включая дистиллированную или кондуктометрическую воду и воду аналогичной чистоты); воздух жидкий (с удалением или без удаления инертных газов); воздух сжатый; амальгамы, кроме амальгам драгоценных металлов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14888/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14888" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14888"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfastwdkag/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14889/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14889" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14889"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasrcziku/"></a>2901</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14890/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14890" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14890"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas16fqpz/"></a>Углеводороды ациклические</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14891/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14891" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14891"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasooegui/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top