<td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14927/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14927" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14927"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasyagyn5/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14928/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14928" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14928"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasdr1od0/"></a>2914</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14929/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14929" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14929"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas29g7sy/"></a>Кетоны и хиноны, содержащие или не содержащие другую кислородсодержащую функциональную группу, и их галогенированные, сульфированные, нитрованные или нитрозированные производные</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14930/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14930" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14930"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgw3xf7/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr14931/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14931" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14931"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgrmpev/"></a>2915</p></td><