n: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr15746/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15746" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15746"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas19tggq/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr15747/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15747" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15747"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfascq27qn/"></a>5206</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr15748/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15748" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15748"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas4ssge2/"></a>Пряжа хлопчатобумажная (кроме швейных ниток), содержащая менее 85 мас.% хлопковых волокон, не расфасованная для розничной продажи</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr15749/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15749" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15749"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfastdm2sv/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr15750/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15750" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15750"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaszgpeb9/"></a>5207</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-