as9zuf0q/"></a>20, но не менее 1,5 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16056/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16056" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16056"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasy4ggtk/"></a>6106</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16057/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16057" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16057"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasghrc4g/"></a>Блузки, блузы и блузоны трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания, женские или для девочек</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16058/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16058" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16058"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaswk6qa8/"></a>20, но не менее 1 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16059/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16059" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16059"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasnmb6gg/"></a>6107</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16060/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16060" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16060"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbfc4pp/"></a>Кальсоны, трусы, ночные сорочки, пижамы, купальные халаты, домашние халаты и аналогичные изделия трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания, мужские или для мальчиков, кроме:</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16061/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16061" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16061"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas2r0ag4/"></a>20, но не менее 1,5 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16062/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16062" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16062"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasnptdkg/"></a>610711 &#8212; 610719</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16063/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16063" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16063"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasggubly/"></a>трусы и кальсоны мужские или для мальчиков</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16064/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16064" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16064"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasqqnptu/"></a>20, но не менее 0,2 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16065/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16065" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16065"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasr7czo6/"></a>6108</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16066/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16066" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16066"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasntksmc/"></a>Комбинации, нижние юбки, трусы, панталоны, ночные сорочки, пижамы, пеньюары, купальные халаты, домашние халаты и аналогичные изделия трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания, женские или для девочек, кроме:</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16067/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16067" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16067"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaseeg4fz/"></a>20, но не менее 1 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16068/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16068" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16068"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas56kh4y/"></a>610821 &#8212; 610829</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16069/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16069" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16069"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasrrm73t/"></a>трусы и панталоны женские или для девочек</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16070/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16070" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16070"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas30emq6/"></a>20, но не менее 0,2 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16071/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16071" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16071"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas7257nl/"></a>6109</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16072/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16072" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16072"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbv7ea1/"></a>Майки, фуфайки с рукавами и прочие нательные фуфайки трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16073/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16073" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16073"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfassgh6a6/"></a>20, но не менее 0,5 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16074/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16074" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16074"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbwwxq8/"></a>6110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16075/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16075" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16075"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasuagve5/"></a>Свитеры, пуловеры, кардиганы, жилеты и аналогичные изделия трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16076/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16076" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16076"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas703tg7/"></a>20, но не менее 1 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16077/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16077" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16077"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasotrsm1/"></a>6111</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16078/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16078" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16078"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasav0g8k/"></a>Детская одежда и принадлежности к детской одежде трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16079/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16079" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16079"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasd17u9i/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16080/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16080" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16080"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasb6ho1g/"></a>6112</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16081/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16081" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16081"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas95g4te/"></a>Костюмы спортивные, лыжные и купальные трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16082/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16082" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16082"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas5nze97/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16083/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16083" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16083"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaswbg58u/"></a>611300</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16084/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16084" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16084"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas3hr94h/"></a>Предметы одежды из трикотажного полотна машинного или ручного вязания товарной позиции 5903, 5906 или 5907</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16085/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16085" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16085"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasppgol7/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16086/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16086" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16086"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfastruazw/"></a>6114</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16087/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16087" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16087"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas3q4fe2/"></a>Предметы одежды прочие трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16088/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16088" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16088"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfass9wr0n/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16089/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16089" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16089"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas061aa4/"></a>6115</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16090/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16090" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16090"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas1lessg/"></a>Колготы, чулки, гольфы, носки и подследники и прочие чулочно-носочные изделия, включая компрессионные чулочно-носочные изделия с распределенным давлением (например, чулки для страдающих варикозным расширением вен) и обувь без подошв, трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16091/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16091" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16091"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasyvavt1/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16092/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16092" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16092"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasv5ggp3/"></a>6116</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16093/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16093" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16093"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfastq3d8x/"></a>Перчатки, рукавицы и митенки трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16094/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16094" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16094"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasq4kaxg/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16095/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16095" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16095"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasui8u4i/"></a>6117</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16096/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16096" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16096"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasrqc1gc/"></a>Принадлежности к одежде трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания готовые прочие; части одежды или принадлежностей к одежде трикотажные машинного или ручного вязания, кроме:</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16097/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16097" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16097"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasd5zbss/"></a>10</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16098/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16098" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16098"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas7rz7xa/"></a>6117100000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16099/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16099" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16099"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas2o6gwg/"></a>шали, шарфы, платки, кашне, мантильи, вуали и аналогичные изделия трикотажные, машинного или ручного вязания</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16100/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16100" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16100"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasgf8s2z/"></a>20, но не менее 0,5 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16101/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16101" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16101"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasg3nmwa/"></a>6201</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16102/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16102" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16102"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas3tbxn7/"></a>Пальто, полупальто, накидки, плащи, куртки (включая лыжные), ветровки, штормовки и аналогичные изделия мужские или для мальчиков, кроме изделий товарной позиции 6203</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16103/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16103" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16103"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaskkoibr/"></a>20, но не менее 4 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16104/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16104" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16104"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasrht2pn/"></a>6202</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16105/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16105" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16105"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasxeexwi/"></a>Пальто, полупальто, накидки, плащи, куртки (включая лыжные), ветровки, штормовки и аналогичные изделия женские или для девочек, кроме изделий товарной позиции 6204</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16106/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16106" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16106"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasfsd76e/"></a>20, но не менее 4 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16107/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16107" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16107"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas2lhx7g/"></a>6203</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16108/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16108" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16108"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasfgpd64/"></a>Костюмы, комплекты, пиджаки, блайзеры, брюки, комбинезоны с нагрудниками и лямками, бриджи и шорты (кроме купальных) мужские или для мальчиков, кроме:</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16109/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16109" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16109"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas0apvxt/"></a>20, но не менее 2 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16110/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16110" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16110"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasc90vqt/"></a>6203110000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16111/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16111" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16111"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasglzxgt/"></a>костюмы мужские или для мальчиков из шерстяной пряжи или пряжи из тонкого волоса животных</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16112/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16112" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16112"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasfw0258/"></a>20, но не менее 4 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16113/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16113" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16113"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfastt85az/"></a>6203120000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16114/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16114" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16114"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasmq3rp9/"></a>костюмы мужские или для мальчиков из синтетических нитей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16115/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16115" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16115"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasbg295k/"></a>20, но не менее 4 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16116/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16116" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16116"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas6db6g6/"></a>6203191000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16117/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16117" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16117"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas1nnilv/"></a>костюмы мужские или для мальчиков из хлопчатобумажной пряжи</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16118/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="16118" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr16118"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasnbdcqq/"></a>20, но не менее 3 долл. США/шт.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/bssPhr16119/" data-