left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfastiml9t/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfaszv2qts/"></a>8001</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasp7fo87/"></a>Олово необработанное</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasokl7qf/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas037w3f/"></a>8002000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasvv5sq2/"></a>Отходы и лом оловянные</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasl6xpiz/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasa1l5nv/"></a>8003000000</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 65%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfas2bol7t/"></a>Прутки, профили и проволока оловянные</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/dfasvhoh1g/"></a>0</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/18678/d